WEBVTT

00:01.175 --> 00:04.553
Hey, Boss, Alna.

00:04.553 --> 00:06.488
Are you two okay?

00:07.264 --> 00:09.892
I was told to check on you
since you're taking so long.

00:09.892 --> 00:12.019
The chief sure knows
how to get people working.

00:12.311 --> 00:15.064
Though I was honestly worried
about Alna.

00:16.266 --> 00:17.184
Huh?

00:17.870 --> 00:19.861
T-That's...

00:21.806 --> 00:23.280
I will marry you.

00:23.674 --> 00:25.866
I will marry you...

00:25.866 --> 00:28.369
I will marry you, I will marry you...

00:28.994 --> 00:29.870
I will marry you...

00:29.870 --> 00:32.998
- Hey Alna, calm down.
- I will marry you...

00:34.917 --> 00:40.881
Let out an exhausted sigh,
the corner of my heart dyed in blue

00:41.131 --> 00:43.300
Brightening up this place

00:43.300 --> 00:46.011
Looking up at a proud self

00:46.470 --> 00:48.973
Amidst a world constantly turning upside down

00:48.973 --> 00:51.642
On the only path where I seemed to be lost

00:51.642 --> 00:54.812
I still stand firm on my own two feet

00:56.981 --> 01:01.485
Lamenting my lonely fate,
looking up at the distant sky

01:01.485 --> 01:05.698
Without a single reply
but we are still connected

01:07.908 --> 01:10.035
When will it end?

01:10.619 --> 01:13.664
The incompetent will eventually fall

01:14.665 --> 01:18.627
I wonder when this red color
will be completely eradicated

01:20.004 --> 01:22.965
Brushing everything aside,
soaring into the sky

01:22.965 --> 01:27.511
My heart is bright blue

01:27.511 --> 01:28.679
I can't fall anymore

01:28.679 --> 01:34.310
Let out an exhausted sigh,
the corner of my heart dyed in blue

01:34.310 --> 01:39.523
Raising my fist high,
determined to go to the very end

01:39.523 --> 01:41.942
Even if I'm knocked down by life a hundred times

01:41.942 --> 01:44.653
This blue color will still protect me

01:44.653 --> 01:49.950
Looking up at a proud self

01:55.247 --> 01:58.000
The endless song will echoes forever

01:58.000 --> 02:00.878
I am a proud blue color

02:06.258 --> 02:07.551
Hey!

02:07.760 --> 02:11.722
Dias took down the Earth Dragon!

02:14.087 --> 02:17.436
Transporting the giant turtle
was incredibly hard work.

02:17.720 --> 02:23.317
It wasn't until dawn that we
finally managed to bring it back to the village.

02:26.070 --> 02:28.322
Is it really something
to make a fuss over?

02:29.027 --> 02:32.810
I didn't expect anyone
to take it down single-handedly.

02:33.202 --> 02:34.036
Mall.

02:34.662 --> 02:39.500
I want to exchange the materials from this thing
to ask everyone to dig a well and build a toilet.

02:39.500 --> 02:40.417
Is this enough?

02:40.864 --> 02:42.378
It's more than enough.

02:42.528 --> 02:47.049
Just one of its legs
is enough to pay for all that.

02:47.049 --> 02:49.385
Is it really that valuable?

02:49.426 --> 02:51.637
So high that you won't be able to use it all up.

02:52.452 --> 02:55.808
Most of the materials will eventually
be returned to you anyway.

02:56.425 --> 03:00.429
We'll only take some as payment for dismantling it.

03:01.021 --> 03:03.565
Then we'll build the well and the toilet...

03:03.651 --> 03:08.156
and prepare the materials for the nomadic tent,
food, and herbs.

03:08.737 --> 03:11.478
We'll also set up another tent
for you to use for storage.

03:11.740 --> 03:13.450
That would be great.

03:13.867 --> 03:14.952
Also...

03:15.369 --> 03:17.579
we'll need to prepare for Alna's wedding.

03:19.164 --> 03:21.500
If you just give them a claw
or a fang...

03:21.500 --> 03:24.712
her parents will be overjoyed.

03:24.712 --> 03:28.757
Wait, hold on a minute. What wedding?

03:29.133 --> 03:31.802
Whether you like it or not,
you have to marry her.

03:32.261 --> 03:36.890
A neighbor who can slay a dragon must
form an unbreakable bond with us.

03:36.890 --> 03:39.393
Otherwise, how could we feel at ease?

03:39.893 --> 03:40.769
Furthermore...

03:41.186 --> 03:43.856
you're a capable man
who can even kill a dragon.

03:44.148 --> 03:46.024
If you don't marry Alna...

03:46.024 --> 03:49.945
all the single women in the village
will swarm all over you.

03:51.530 --> 03:53.574
That would be troublesome.

03:53.907 --> 03:56.618
See? But don't worry.

03:57.026 --> 04:01.140
Alna has already gone to inform
her parents about the marriage.

04:01.165 --> 04:02.207
Huh?

04:02.416 --> 04:05.210
No wonder I haven't seen her around.

04:07.254 --> 04:11.717
For example, would it be possible
to just get engaged first?

04:12.259 --> 04:15.554
Our demon tribe doesn't have
the custom of engagement.

04:16.138 --> 04:20.809
Just get married first, and you can
"do it" at any time you want.

04:20.809 --> 04:23.364
That's the best way.

04:25.272 --> 04:26.940
The closer our relationship is,

04:27.107 --> 04:31.862
the easier it will be for us
to help you become a great lord.

04:33.614 --> 04:37.451
I appreciate your concern,
but why are you helping me so much?

04:38.052 --> 04:39.912
If you fail...

04:39.912 --> 04:43.665
we have no idea what kind of person
the next lord will be.

04:44.416 --> 04:47.694
The previous one was a hopeless fool.

04:48.128 --> 04:50.447
I heard he died of an illness recently.

04:52.747 --> 04:56.804
So do your best, my lord.

04:57.805 --> 05:00.265
Alna is amazing.

05:00.265 --> 05:01.696
Being so young and all.

05:02.351 --> 05:05.145
Hey, how old is Alna?

05:05.562 --> 05:07.648
She just turned 15.

05:07.648 --> 05:11.610
To find such a great catch like you
as soon as she reached marriageable age.

05:11.610 --> 05:13.237
It's truly admirable.

05:14.898 --> 05:16.890
F-Fifteen years old!?

05:17.866 --> 05:22.162
Compared to a 35-year-old guy like me,
it's like father and daughter.

05:23.288 --> 05:26.333
In the kingdom, you have to be 18
to get married.

05:26.917 --> 05:29.753
So let's see it as an engagement
for the next three years.

05:29.962 --> 05:33.048
During that time, I must become
a capable lord.

05:33.715 --> 05:35.968
Before then, I must also
ready myself mentally.

05:36.648 --> 05:38.846
As a lord and as a man.

05:39.471 --> 05:40.472
Dias.

05:41.022 --> 05:42.725
I've finished talking to them.

05:44.741 --> 05:45.978
By the way...

05:46.813 --> 05:49.356
what do you want
for breakfast tomorrow?

05:52.719 --> 05:54.111
I'll let you decide.

05:54.611 --> 05:55.904
Is that so?

05:55.988 --> 05:58.156
Then see you later.

06:02.160 --> 06:03.912
Alna is so beautiful!

06:03.912 --> 06:05.163
Congratulations.

06:05.163 --> 06:06.290
Congratulations.

06:06.290 --> 06:08.750
I'm so jealous, you're marrying Alna.

06:08.750 --> 06:12.087
I have to admit,
your masculinity is truly formidable.

06:12.087 --> 06:14.882
To marry such a capable man...

06:14.882 --> 06:17.175
Alna will be really happy.

06:17.175 --> 06:19.553
No, we're just engaged for now.

06:19.553 --> 06:22.723
Don't be shy, dragon slayer.

06:27.366 --> 06:29.521
Sometime after that feast...

06:29.877 --> 06:33.608
the well and the toilet were completed,
and my life gradually stabilized.

06:36.050 --> 06:39.740
Okay, for my first ever time building it,
it turned out decently.

06:40.288 --> 06:43.577
Yet, to ensure that future residents
won't have to sleep outdoors...

06:43.702 --> 06:46.788
I need to get even better at setting up tents.

06:48.707 --> 06:52.961
But how can I get people
to come to my territory?

06:54.779 --> 06:55.507
Dias.

06:56.683 --> 06:58.383
Is it lunchtime already?

06:58.657 --> 07:02.387
No, there's a monster reaction
in the North.

07:03.888 --> 07:07.059
I've set up life-sensing essences
all over the grassland.

07:07.665 --> 07:09.269
Something just triggered it.

07:09.269 --> 07:10.420
Do you know the number?

07:11.024 --> 07:11.867
Just one.

07:12.359 --> 07:14.292
It's not very large in size either...

07:14.632 --> 07:17.068
but it seems to be heading this way.

07:19.112 --> 07:22.991
We can't let it destroy the well and
the toilet that we just built.

07:23.116 --> 07:26.954
Furthermore, we mustn't let others
like Francis live in fear.

07:27.315 --> 07:28.913
I'll go take care of it.

07:29.289 --> 07:31.166
Naturally, I'm coming with you.

07:31.166 --> 07:35.212
Even if it's small, it's still a monster,
we have to fight it together.

07:35.504 --> 07:37.798
But what about Francis and François?

07:39.180 --> 07:41.051
They're sleeping in the barn now.

07:41.051 --> 07:44.805
If they wake up and don't see anyone,
they'll be so lonely they'll cry.

07:45.601 --> 07:50.671
Mear that are used to humans will feel uneasy
if they don't sense their presence.

07:52.162 --> 07:53.772
Just leave them to those guys.

07:59.861 --> 08:01.446
It's an Ogre, isn't it?

08:01.773 --> 08:02.823
Yeah.

08:03.198 --> 08:07.536
The materials from it smell so bad
it makes you nauseous, it's useless for anything.

08:07.536 --> 08:09.788
There's no benefit in hunting it.

08:09.788 --> 08:13.000
Can't be helped, we can't let it
get any closer.

08:20.215 --> 08:21.883
It's really fast.

08:25.262 --> 08:26.078
Dias!

08:26.968 --> 08:28.557
I'll hold it back for you.

08:28.932 --> 08:30.559
You just go in and attack.

08:30.934 --> 08:31.727
Got it.

08:34.688 --> 08:35.897
Go, Dias!

08:45.641 --> 08:46.350
You did it.

08:47.451 --> 08:48.994
All thanks to you.

08:48.994 --> 08:52.247
I told you,
fighting together is better.

08:52.497 --> 08:54.750
We're husband and wife, after all.

08:55.642 --> 08:58.587
No, we're just engaged,
we're not married yet...

08:59.463 --> 09:00.964
The Ogre's blood...

09:00.964 --> 09:02.382
stinks so much.

09:02.382 --> 09:03.717
Go wash it off.

09:03.717 --> 09:06.678
Until the smell is gone,
don't bother entering the tent.

09:07.637 --> 09:08.805
Okay...

09:11.141 --> 09:12.934
Is it afternoon already?

09:13.518 --> 09:14.811
This is terrible.

09:15.394 --> 09:18.689
I didn't expect this smell
to be so persistent.

09:22.027 --> 09:26.448
THE FRONTIER LORD AND HIS FIRST GUEST

09:33.875 --> 09:36.752
Yesterday was truly unlucky.

09:37.084 --> 09:40.545
There are no people in sight,
but monsters keep flocking here.

09:41.213 --> 09:43.048
What should I do?

09:43.465 --> 09:46.843
Dias! She's pregnant!

09:46.843 --> 09:48.512
R-Really?

09:48.512 --> 09:51.181
Yeah, she's having a baby.

09:53.308 --> 09:56.937
Hooray!

09:57.187 --> 09:59.314
Good girl, good girl.

09:59.592 --> 10:01.691
You did great, François.

10:02.025 --> 10:04.653
I didn't expect you to have a baby so soon.

10:08.678 --> 10:10.909
Is Francis getting jealous?

10:11.118 --> 10:13.051
You've also worked hard.

10:13.537 --> 10:15.372
There, there.

10:15.885 --> 10:18.041
But actually...

10:18.458 --> 10:20.877
we can't just be happy about this.

10:22.174 --> 10:26.174
Do you remember I said
Mear are very intelligent?

10:26.737 --> 10:27.300
Yeah.

10:27.884 --> 10:30.929
They completely understand
human language.

10:31.035 --> 10:34.540
Because they want to live safely,
they become domesticated, right?

10:35.110 --> 10:35.851
That's right.

10:36.454 --> 10:40.522
Since they are so intelligent, they are very
sensitive to fear and mental stress...

10:40.522 --> 10:43.049
when they are pregnant,
it's even more severe.

10:43.775 --> 10:47.362
Some are even driven
to death by fear.

10:48.780 --> 10:53.201
Therefore, until she gives birth,
the strongest person here...

10:53.201 --> 10:58.373
which is you, must always be by
her side to reassure her.

10:59.082 --> 11:02.711
That's why I plan to bring
Francis and François into the tent.

11:03.323 --> 11:06.840
But doing so will make
the inside dirty and smelly.

11:07.878 --> 11:11.411
There are many men who hate that.

11:12.120 --> 11:15.415
Every time
a Mear gets pregnant, they argue.

11:17.534 --> 11:19.828
Oh, is that all?

11:19.853 --> 11:22.063
I don't mind at all.

11:23.523 --> 11:26.693
Francis and François are both
important family members.

11:27.569 --> 11:30.572
As long as she gives birth safely...

11:31.272 --> 11:33.700
that little inconvenience
means nothing.

11:36.119 --> 11:40.123
Not only are you manly,
but you're also gentle.

11:40.540 --> 11:42.375
You truly are my husband.

11:42.626 --> 11:44.085
Yeah...

11:48.715 --> 11:51.426
Are you guys happy too?

11:51.760 --> 11:54.054
What are you saying, François?

11:54.054 --> 11:55.764
Dias and I haven't...

11:56.389 --> 11:58.808
Francis, you're talking nonsense!

11:58.808 --> 12:02.354
We are building our relationship
little by little.

12:02.687 --> 12:03.813
Our relationship...

12:04.250 --> 12:06.316
Just forget about that.

12:08.568 --> 12:09.277
Green?

12:09.887 --> 12:11.655
Is something coming again?

12:11.988 --> 12:12.989
Yes.

12:13.448 --> 12:15.116
From the East.

12:15.867 --> 12:17.619
This feeling...

12:18.119 --> 12:19.412
it must be humans.

12:19.996 --> 12:21.248
There are horses too.

12:21.665 --> 12:24.918
I'm guessing around 10 people.

12:25.627 --> 12:26.920
The East...

12:26.920 --> 12:31.383
That's the direction of the Royal Capital,
but I don't remember expecting any guests.

12:31.883 --> 12:33.426
Let me go check it out.

12:33.843 --> 12:37.764
You should use concealment
and hide with Francis and François.

12:40.350 --> 12:42.560
It's okay, I'll be right back.

12:42.852 --> 12:46.356
How could they be harder to deal
with than a dragon?

12:46.856 --> 12:48.692
I'll keep watch for you.

12:49.047 --> 12:49.693
Okay.

12:54.831 --> 12:55.449
Found them.

12:56.157 --> 12:58.326
Three cavalrymen, four infantrymen.

12:58.827 --> 13:01.746
Including the horses, there are 10 indeed.

13:02.402 --> 13:03.748
Are they enemies or allies?

13:04.416 --> 13:07.168
If they are enemies and have bows,
it'll be troublesome.

13:07.502 --> 13:09.129
I'll just get closer first.

13:10.547 --> 13:13.258
Dias, long time no see.

13:14.926 --> 13:17.804
You're... Klaus?

13:17.804 --> 13:18.430
Yes.

13:19.889 --> 13:21.933
I heard you were appointed as a lord.

13:21.933 --> 13:25.437
Seeing a good comrade in comflict
getting promoted makes me glad.

13:25.437 --> 13:28.315
Seeing a good friend healthy
also makes me happy.

13:28.565 --> 13:31.693
But what are you doing all the way out here?

13:32.027 --> 13:34.988
I was just ordered to guide
and escort them.

13:35.572 --> 13:39.492
The person over there has business with you.

13:41.238 --> 13:42.364
That person is...

13:45.645 --> 13:46.250
who?

13:47.334 --> 13:49.419
Could you lead us to the mansion?

13:49.711 --> 13:53.465
We've been traveling for over half a month,
so we're all exhausted.

13:53.882 --> 13:57.302
Hmm, talking about a mansion...

14:04.351 --> 14:07.562
It's good that I told Alna
to use concealment on everything...

14:07.562 --> 14:09.314
but my self-made tent for practice.

14:10.591 --> 14:13.568
I promised to keep
the demon tribe a secret.

14:13.568 --> 14:16.196
Besides, it'll be chaotic
to explain right now.

14:18.323 --> 14:19.783
T-There is a hole...

14:20.283 --> 14:23.203
Did it tear when we were setting up the tent?

14:25.274 --> 14:27.666
Nice to meet you, Hero Dias.

14:28.172 --> 14:29.959
It's an honor to meet you.

14:30.590 --> 14:34.005
I am the Third Princess, Diane.

14:34.604 --> 14:35.728
A princess?

14:36.368 --> 14:38.467
Why did she personally come
all the way here?

14:39.055 --> 14:43.390
So, is your mansion
still under construction?

14:43.848 --> 14:46.476
I don't see any servants either.

14:46.876 --> 14:49.662
Oh, you're Ms. Diane, right?

14:49.687 --> 14:52.505
Insolent, you must address her
as Princess Diane!

14:52.862 --> 14:54.025
Know your place.

14:55.985 --> 14:57.695
It's fine, stand down.

14:59.959 --> 15:04.244
Ms. Diane, there's no mansion here,
nor are there any servants.

15:04.702 --> 15:06.579
There's only this tent.

15:07.248 --> 15:11.985
It might not look like much,
but I worked hard to set it up myself.

15:14.007 --> 15:15.130
You set it up yourself?

15:15.672 --> 15:17.799
Where are the builders?

15:18.299 --> 15:19.926
I heard my father...

15:19.926 --> 15:25.682
I mean, His Majesty granted you a large sum
as a reward and for preparations.

15:25.807 --> 15:27.142
What do you mean?

15:27.725 --> 15:31.187
I haven't received a single penny.

15:31.521 --> 15:32.939
Impossible.

15:33.356 --> 15:37.569
Never mind money,
I didn't even have water or food.

15:37.569 --> 15:40.947
At first, I thought
I was going to starve to death here.

15:45.285 --> 15:49.456
So what business do you have with me?

15:51.541 --> 15:52.792
War.

15:54.502 --> 15:58.882
Right now in the Royal Capital,
the threat of a new conflict is growing.

15:59.257 --> 16:02.927
Therefore, we would like to invite you...

16:02.927 --> 16:06.139
the hero who saved the nation,
to return and help.

16:07.140 --> 16:08.725
The reward will be...

16:09.142 --> 16:13.688
marriage to me, Prinesia, or Miralda,
who are sitting back there.

16:16.232 --> 16:18.109
A new conflict?

16:18.109 --> 16:19.694
You've got to be kidding me.

16:20.403 --> 16:24.657
I can't leave François right now.

16:25.158 --> 16:29.704
Besides, how can marrying someone
you just met be considered a reward?

16:34.542 --> 16:35.919
I'm sorry, Madame Diane.

16:36.252 --> 16:38.755
I will not take part in any more wars.

16:40.381 --> 16:42.217
I can't send troops to help either.

16:42.217 --> 16:46.054
As you can see, let alone soldiers,
I don't even have a single citizen.

16:47.597 --> 16:50.058
Can't you reconsider?

16:50.058 --> 16:51.851
I can also add to the reward...

16:51.851 --> 16:53.186
I can't help you.

16:53.436 --> 16:56.356
If that's all you're here for, please leave.

16:56.356 --> 16:57.732
You bastard!

16:57.732 --> 17:01.736
A mere commoner like you dares to keep
showing disrespect to Princess Diane?

17:01.736 --> 17:02.709
This will not slide!

17:03.126 --> 17:03.822
Hey!

17:08.201 --> 17:09.953
My hands are numb...

17:10.537 --> 17:13.957
That can hardly be called bloodlust, can it?

17:14.499 --> 17:17.669
If you're trying to intimidate me,
you're way out of your league.

17:19.824 --> 17:21.099
We're done here, right?

17:21.339 --> 17:22.799
Please leave.

17:23.091 --> 17:24.717
Let's go.

17:24.717 --> 17:27.011
It'll be troublesome if we
continue to anger him.

17:27.178 --> 17:28.304
But...

17:28.388 --> 17:31.474
Even if we all attack at once,
we won't be able to defeat him.

17:32.308 --> 17:33.977
Or do you still wish to challenge...

17:34.894 --> 17:36.854
the nation's hero?

17:52.521 --> 17:55.373
I accidentally tore the carpet.

17:55.373 --> 17:57.875
Alna is going to scold me again.

18:00.795 --> 18:04.382
Dias, how dare he turn me away?

18:04.716 --> 18:06.884
There will come a day
when you regret this.

18:13.195 --> 18:16.103
Those women were all red.

18:17.157 --> 18:19.230
Only one soldier
was a very deep blue.

18:19.230 --> 18:21.215
The rest of them
were just red and white.

18:21.399 --> 18:23.610
Alna, since when have you been there?

18:23.985 --> 18:28.531
As expected,
François kept crying to be with you.

18:28.906 --> 18:33.077
So I had to use concealment magic
and stand here to watch.

18:34.287 --> 18:38.541
Sorry for leaving you behind, François.

18:39.699 --> 18:40.918
And Francis too.

18:48.338 --> 18:49.927
Thank you, Alna.

18:52.670 --> 18:57.811
By the way, does those girls glowing red
mean they see you as an enemy?

18:58.144 --> 19:01.064
No, my soul appraisal magic...

19:01.064 --> 19:05.026
shows whether they see you and me
as enemies or not.

19:06.069 --> 19:09.656
Because we are family now.

19:12.075 --> 19:13.242
I see.

19:13.701 --> 19:14.911
That's right.

19:16.371 --> 19:19.916
That soldier glowing deep blue must be...

19:22.332 --> 19:23.753
By the way, Dias.

19:23.878 --> 19:26.839
Who do you think is going to fix that?

19:27.769 --> 19:29.926
Ah, sorry about that.

19:44.247 --> 19:45.567
Good morning, Dias.

19:46.776 --> 19:48.152
We have a visitor.

19:48.528 --> 19:51.823
Just one person, coming from the East.

19:52.281 --> 19:54.575
That person is staggering.

19:55.031 --> 19:57.245
Probably a lost traveler.

20:03.105 --> 20:04.502
Are you coming too?

20:05.386 --> 20:07.499
It's just one person, so it's fine.

20:07.856 --> 20:09.298
I'll use concealment too.

20:09.841 --> 20:12.802
I don't want to see François cry anymore.

20:15.775 --> 20:16.472
Got it.

20:27.067 --> 20:28.520
Is that Klaus?

20:29.444 --> 20:30.987
Dias!

20:30.987 --> 20:34.323
I was trying to find you but got lost.

20:36.113 --> 20:38.119
Didn't you head back to the Royal Capital?

20:38.327 --> 20:41.330
Also, where is your armor?

20:41.330 --> 20:45.084
Ah, I got kicked out of the army.

20:45.084 --> 20:47.420
My sword and armor were confiscated too.

20:47.712 --> 20:50.798
What... Could it be my fault?

20:50.798 --> 20:53.426
Because I turned those girls away?

20:53.426 --> 20:54.802
No, it's not.

20:54.802 --> 20:58.723
If war breaks out again,
I'd definitely be sent to the front lines.

20:59.182 --> 21:01.767
I didn't want that,
so I was discharged in disgrace.

21:01.976 --> 21:03.603
I see.

21:03.811 --> 21:06.856
That's good too,
because I also have something I want to do.

21:07.581 --> 21:10.526
Oh? What do you want to do?

21:12.445 --> 21:15.740
Dias, I want to work for you.

21:15.948 --> 21:19.076
Could you hire me as a soldier
in your territory?

21:21.078 --> 21:25.583
Klaus has never discriminated against me
for being an orphan.

21:26.083 --> 21:30.546
On the battlefield, he's also someone
I can confidently trust to watch my back.

21:31.390 --> 21:33.925
Having him as an ally
would be reassuring.

21:34.398 --> 21:35.468
But...

21:35.824 --> 21:36.594
Dias.

21:37.178 --> 21:38.721
I don't object.

21:39.847 --> 21:42.393
This person has always been blue.

21:42.975 --> 21:45.353
You're hesitating as
you wanted my opinion, right?

21:45.972 --> 21:47.396
Thank you, Dias.

21:49.106 --> 21:50.817
Dias...

21:50.817 --> 21:53.861
Where did this girl and those sheep-like creatures come from?

21:54.153 --> 21:56.489
It's a long story.

21:56.864 --> 21:59.408
Just follow me for now, Klaus.

21:59.534 --> 22:00.224
Yes.

22:00.632 --> 22:02.057
Thank you so much!

22:03.608 --> 22:04.899
And just like that...

22:05.406 --> 22:06.953
I got a new citizenin my territory.
CURRENT STATUS REPORTOF NETZROS TERRITORY

22:06.978 --> 22:08.666
I got a new citizenin my territory.
CITIZENS: DEMON TRIBE GIRL: ALNA FORMER KINGDOM SOLDIER

22:08.691 --> 22:09.397
FORMER KINGDOM SOLDIER WHO ADMIRES THE
HERO: KLAUS SHEEP-LIKE CREATURES: TWO MEAR

22:09.422 --> 22:10.086
FACILITIES: TWO NOMADIC TENTS, TWO
STOREHOUSES, MEAR BARN, TOILET, WELL

22:10.628 --> 22:15.049
Our hands tightly intertwined
along with our dreams

22:15.424 --> 22:19.512
The future we draw together

22:19.512 --> 22:23.516
Is always waiting there

22:31.399 --> 22:36.153
I don't know why
it's still that familiar path

22:36.153 --> 22:40.950
But there are days when my heart
suddenly feels heavy and wants to give up

22:41.200 --> 22:45.705
Tears fall, then a smile blooms

22:45.705 --> 22:50.960
Everyone in life has stepped through
days like that

22:51.502 --> 22:56.215
No matter what form
the dawn greets us in

22:56.215 --> 23:00.469
The promise made under the meteor shower

23:00.469 --> 23:03.264
Will never fade

23:03.264 --> 23:07.894
Nor can it be tarnished

23:07.894 --> 23:09.353
Please believe me

23:09.353 --> 23:14.066
Our hands tightly intertwined
along with our dreams

23:14.066 --> 23:18.863
Even if one day we accidentally lose each other

23:18.863 --> 23:23.451
We will definitely meet again under that sky

23:23.451 --> 23:29.290
It is a certainty
